                          '\\begin{equation}', '  X = \\frac{C_\\mathrm{in} - C_\\mathrm{out}}{C_\\mathrm{in}} \\times 100\\,\\%', '  \\label{eq:conv}', '\\end{equation}', 'The apparent activation energy was $E_\\mathrm{a} = \\SI{' + ('58 \\pm 3' if v else '62 \\pm 4') + '}{\\kilo\\joule\\per\\mole}$.', '\\section{Results and discussion}',
